{"slug":"greetings-starter-l5","artistFeel":"NSYNC","beat":"Dance Upbeat","data":{"title":"Greetings & Conversation — Starter · Lesson 5","subject":"greetings","subjectLabel":"Greetings & Conversation","level":"starter","lesson":5,"totalLessons":20,"genre":"90s","lyrics":"[Intro]\nUh, hey there!\n\n[Hook]\nHello… Hola\nHow are you?… ¿Cómo estás?\nLet's talk… Vamos a platicar\nOne, two… Uno, dos\nFeel the rhythm, let's go far.\n\n[Verse]\nAt the market, colors bright,\nFruits and veggies, what a sight.\nGood evening… Buenas noches\nPeople smiling, feeling close.\nAnd you?… ¿Y tú?\nI'm doing fine… Estoy bien\nWaving hi, saying hi.\nThank you… Gracias\nYou're welcome… De nada\nFriendly faces everywhere.\n\n[Hook]\nHello… Hola\nHow are you?… ¿Cómo estás?\nLet's talk… Vamos a platicar\nOne, two… Uno, dos\nFeel the rhythm, let's go far.\n\n[Verse]\nMeeting new friends, hand in hand,\nWhat's your name?… ¿Cómo te llamas?\nNice to meet you… Mucho gusto\nWhere you from?… ¿De dónde eres?\nWhat are you doing?… ¿Qué haces?\nHow old are you?… ¿Cuántos años tienes?\nPleased to meet you… Encantado\nHow's it going?… ¿Qué tal?\nLearning fast, having fun.\n\n[Bridge]\nIn the sun, under the sky,\nEvery moment, we give it a try.\nHola again, as we roam,\nIn this busy market, we feel at home.\n\n[Hook]","vocab":[{"es":"buenas noches","en":"good evening"},{"es":"¿y tú?","en":"and you?"},{"es":"bien","en":"fine"},{"es":"¿cómo te llamas?","en":"what's your name?"},{"es":"mucho gusto","en":"nice to meet you"},{"es":"¿de dónde eres?","en":"where are you from?"},{"es":"¿qué haces?","en":"what are you doing?"},{"es":"¿cuántos años tienes?","en":"how old are you?"},{"es":"encantado","en":"pleased to meet you"},{"es":"¿qué tal?","en":"how's it going?"},{"es":"¿qué piensas?","en":"what do you think?"},{"es":"¿hablas español?","en":"do you speak Spanish?"},{"es":"¿puedes repetir?","en":"can you repeat?"},{"es":"¿entiendes?","en":"do you understand?"},{"es":"perfecto","en":"perfect"}]},"timings":[{"